{
  "compilerOptions": {
    "tsBuildInfoFile": "./node_modules/.tmp/tsconfig.test.tsbuildinfo",

    "target": "ES2022",
    "lib": ["ES2022", "DOM", "DOM.Iterable"],
    "module": "ESNext",
    "moduleResolution": "bundler",
    "moduleDetection": "force",
    "resolveJsonModule": true,
    "isolatedModules": true,
    "esModuleInterop": true,
    "skipLibCheck": true,
    "noEmit": true,

    "strict": true,
    "noUnusedLocals": true,
    "noUnusedParameters": true,
    "noFallthroughCasesInSwitch": true,
    "noImplicitOverride": true
  },
  /*
   * `api` 也在這裡：測試會直接匯入後端處理器（見 `tests/api.test.ts`），而 TypeScript 需要那些檔案
   * 在同一個 program 裡才編得過。`tsconfig.api.json` 另外單獨檢查一次，所以後端的型別不會因為
   * 「測試剛好沒碰到」而漏掉。
   * `api` is included here too: tests import the backend handlers directly (see
   * `tests/api.test.ts`), and TypeScript needs those files in the same program. `tsconfig.api.json`
   * checks them separately, so a backend type error cannot slip through just because no test happens to
   * touch it.
   */
  "include": ["src", "tests", "api", "vitest.config.ts"]
}
